{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become the Wheelchair!</strong> This hilariously challenging physics racer dares you to master the art of wheelchair movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/2eb9b892ffbaed2b4ef5da303965d594.poster.avif?t=1737902891\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/2eb9b892ffbaed2b4ef5da303965d594.webm?t=1737902891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/2eb9b892ffbaed2b4ef5da303965d594.mp4?t=1737902891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual-Hand Controls:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the challenge with a unique dual-handed control system that tests your left- and right-hand coordination to the limit. Push, pull, and pivot your way through every obstacle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/e49e492edbf98c73ab5750d6e1369248.poster.avif?t=1737902891\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/e49e492edbf98c73ab5750d6e1369248.webm?t=1737902891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/e49e492edbf98c73ab5750d6e1369248.mp4?t=1737902891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Wheelchair Mechanics:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grounded, physics-based controls capture the nuances of wheelchair movement. Play in either third- or first-person view, where even the smallest gap or bump can feel like an impossible challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/9d85b74406bfea807a4bb0a157a1ffdc.poster.avif?t=1737902891\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/9d85b74406bfea807a4bb0a157a1ffdc.webm?t=1737902891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/9d85b74406bfea807a4bb0a157a1ffdc.mp4?t=1737902891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive Race Course:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate creatively designed levels filled with both wacky and relatable obstacles inspired by everyday experiences in a wheelchair. Discover alternate routes and supporting items to find faster and more innovative ways to beat each course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/02835c1bb646b815c86a9c9208df6493.poster.avif?t=1737902891\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/02835c1bb646b815c86a9c9208df6493.webm?t=1737902891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/02835c1bb646b815c86a9c9208df6493.mp4?t=1737902891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charmingly Absurd Yet Insightful:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By transforming something seemingly ordinary into a chaotic, joyful challenge, <i>Wheelchair Simulator</i> offers a fresh perspective on movement and mobility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/2850faa4b43f9b3819ff7a95a86b99e8.poster.avif?t=1737902891\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/2850faa4b43f9b3819ff7a95a86b99e8.webm?t=1737902891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/2850faa4b43f9b3819ff7a95a86b99e8.mp4?t=1737902891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wheelchair Simulator</i> is designed with respect and appreciation for the experiences of wheelchair users, aiming to bring a unique perspective to platform gaming. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines humor and challenging physics-based gameplay to offer a fresh take on movement mechanics, encouraging empathy and understanding. While the game presents exaggerated obstacles and playful failures, it does so with the intention of celebrating resilience and the creativity required to navigate everyday environments. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope players find it thought-provoking and fun at the same time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3338350?t=1737902891","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3338350?t=1737902891","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/2554f0c04e888f07090908b93ddba3d8f6ff999b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1737902891","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/2554f0c04e888f07090908b93ddba3d8f6ff999b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1737902891","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become the Wheelchair!</strong> This hilariously challenging physics racer dares you to master the art of wheelchair movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/2eb9b892ffbaed2b4ef5da303965d594.poster.avif?t=1737902891\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/2eb9b892ffbaed2b4ef5da303965d594.webm?t=1737902891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/2eb9b892ffbaed2b4ef5da303965d594.mp4?t=1737902891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual-Hand Controls:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the challenge with a unique dual-handed control system that tests your left- and right-hand coordination to the limit. Push, pull, and pivot your way through every obstacle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/e49e492edbf98c73ab5750d6e1369248.poster.avif?t=1737902891\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/e49e492edbf98c73ab5750d6e1369248.webm?t=1737902891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/e49e492edbf98c73ab5750d6e1369248.mp4?t=1737902891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Wheelchair Mechanics:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grounded, physics-based controls capture the nuances of wheelchair movement. Play in either third- or first-person view, where even the smallest gap or bump can feel like an impossible challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/9d85b74406bfea807a4bb0a157a1ffdc.poster.avif?t=1737902891\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/9d85b74406bfea807a4bb0a157a1ffdc.webm?t=1737902891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/9d85b74406bfea807a4bb0a157a1ffdc.mp4?t=1737902891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive Race Course:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate creatively designed levels filled with both wacky and relatable obstacles inspired by everyday experiences in a wheelchair. Discover alternate routes and supporting items to find faster and more innovative ways to beat each course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/02835c1bb646b815c86a9c9208df6493.poster.avif?t=1737902891\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/02835c1bb646b815c86a9c9208df6493.webm?t=1737902891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/02835c1bb646b815c86a9c9208df6493.mp4?t=1737902891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charmingly Absurd Yet Insightful:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By transforming something seemingly ordinary into a chaotic, joyful challenge, <i>Wheelchair Simulator</i> offers a fresh perspective on movement and mobility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/2850faa4b43f9b3819ff7a95a86b99e8.poster.avif?t=1737902891\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/2850faa4b43f9b3819ff7a95a86b99e8.webm?t=1737902891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/extras/2850faa4b43f9b3819ff7a95a86b99e8.mp4?t=1737902891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wheelchair Simulator</i> is designed with respect and appreciation for the experiences of wheelchair users, aiming to bring a unique perspective to platform gaming. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines humor and challenging physics-based gameplay to offer a fresh take on movement mechanics, encouraging empathy and understanding. While the game presents exaggerated obstacles and playful failures, it does so with the intention of celebrating resilience and the creativity required to navigate everyday environments. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope players find it thought-provoking and fun at the same time.</p>","developers":["Flygogo Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338350/header.jpg?t=1737902891","is_fre